        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2804-09, Modern Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Toilet Tissue Holder features a sleek design that features contemporary finishes and clean, sharp corners. This Emtek 280409 Modern Toilet Tissue Holder is available in 6 popular finishes including satin brass, polished nickel, satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, flat black, and polished chrome. It comes complete with all necessary mounting hardware. This single bar style Toilet Paper Holder is a great choice for any bathroom remodel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-towel-bar-emtek-28024-09-1214667\"><b>Modern Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-6-12-inch-towel-ring-emtek-2801-09-1214738\"><b>Modern Towel Ring</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-double-robe-hook-emtek-2809-09-1214669\"><b>Modern Double Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Single Post L Shaped Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Dimensions: 5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-7/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-280409-installation.pdf?v=1718159563\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Toilet Tissue Holder Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2804-specifications.pdf?v=1718159605\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Toilet Tissue Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
